1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,594
Speaking, task four. Situation number 20. The examiner describes a situation. Agree with her, choose one option and say why.

2
00:00:11,433 --> 00:00:20,208
We'll pass the exam and want to celebrate. How shall we celebrate? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

3
00:00:28,867 --> 00:00:31,033
We can go out to a restaurant for dinner.

4
00:00:31,467 --> 00:00:33,424
We go to restaurants often.

5
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:35,353
Then let's go bowling.

6
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,234
I can't bowl.

7
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,735
Then we'll go on a boat trip.

8
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,765
And why do you want to do that?

9
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:44,836
Because the weather will be nice and it's something new.

10
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,675
That's a great idea. Let's go boating.

11
00:00:48,133 --> 00:00:57,561
Practise situation 20 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel — there's a new video every day.
